direction: right
title: SynchronousQueue Direct Handoff Sequence Diagram

Producer: Producer Thread
Queue: SynchronousQueue (0 Capacity)
Consumer: Consumer Thread

Producer -> Queue: 1. put("TASK-101") (Producer parks) {
  style.stroke: "#3B82F6"
}

Consumer -> Queue: 2. take() arrives {
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
}

Queue -> Consumer: 3. Returns "TASK-101" (Direct handoff) {
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
}

Queue -> Producer: Unparks Producer Thread {
  style.stroke: "#3B82F6"
}
